with either finalist.\\\",\\n  why=\\\"Stated: “\\\" + Q[\\\"stb\\\"] + \\\"” (p.32). The filing does not name the firm; recorded generically as the Company's STB counsel (an unnamed firm is not inferred to be a later-named adviser).\\\",\\n  source=[\\\"P-031\\\"], count=None,\\n  dfrom=\\\"2016-08-12\\\", dto=\\\"2016-08-12\\\", wdate=\\\"2016-08-12\\\",\\n  dbasis=\\\"Reported day\\\", dmethod=\\\"Reported\\\", page=32),\\n\\nR(rowid=\\\"R053\\\", n=53, when=\\\"08/12/2016\\\", who=\\\"G&W\\\", what=\\\"Bid\\\", rnd=\\\"3\\\", type=\\\"Strategic\\\",\\n  terms=\\\"Revised LOI at $25.00 per share in cash, excluding the earlier CVR, with mark-ups of the merger agreement and voting agreement (disclosure-letter mark-up followed the same day); offer to expire at 6:00 p.m. on 08/13/2016. Signalled on 08/11/2016 after completing physical diligence.\\\",\\n  why=\\\"Stated: “\\\" + Q[\\\"gw25\\\"] + \\\"” (p.31) and “\\\" + Q[\\\"gwsignal\\\"] + \\\"” (p.31). Formality: Formal — returned agreement markups (signal 1). Conditions: Light — diligence completed (DD open: no), documents still being negotiated to signing; no financing condition in the executed agreement and G&W represented its financial wherewithal (X-015). All cash Yes; $25.00 fixed at closing; CVR removed. Alternative None reading flagged (Q5, Q6).\\\",\\n  source=[\\\"P-027\\\", \\\"P-028\\\", \\\"X-015\\\"], review=\\\"Q5; Q6\\\", count=1,\\n  dfrom=\\\"2016-08-12\\\", dto=\\\"2016-08-12\\\", wdate=\\\"2016-08-12\\\",\\n  dbasis=\\\"Reported day\\\", dmethod=\\\"Reported\\\",\\n  plow=25.00, phigh=25.00, pkind=\\\"Point\\\", porigin=\\\"Stated\\\", currency=\\\"USD\\\",\\n  allcash=\\\"Yes\\\", cashclose=25.00, formality=\\\"Formal\\\", cond=\\\"Light\\\",\\n  cdetail=\\\"Fin: no contingency; DD required: none; DD open: no; Excl: not stated\\\", page=31,\\n  related=\\\"revises R037; accepted at R056\\\"),\\n\\nR(rowid=\\\"R054\\\", n=54, when=\\\"08/12/2016\\\", who=\\\"Party B\\\", what=\\\"Not selected at signing\\\", rnd=\\\"3\\\",\\n  type=\\\"Strategic\\\",\\n  terms=\\\"Still-live finalist: asked by BMO (at the Board's request) whether it would increase its price and it declined; the Board then determined the G&W offer was the superior proposal and signed with G&W. Diligence had ended 08/11/2016. Stage left: Round 3.\\\",\\n  why=\\\"Stated: “\\\" + Q[\\\"bdecline\\\"] + \\\"” (p.32) and “\\\" + Q[\\\"superior\\\"] + \\\"” (p.32). Outcome basis Stated (the bidder was still bidding when the target chose another). Exit reason Would not improve earlier offer, while actual selection agency is the target's.\\\",\\n  source=[\\\"P-031\\\", \\\"P-032\\\"], review=\\\"Q4\\\", count=1,\\n  dfrom=\\\"2016-08-12\\\", dto=\\\"2016-08-12\\\", wdate=\\\"2016-08-12\\\",\\n  dbasis=\\\"Reported day\\\", dmethod=\\\"Reported\\\", page=32,\\n  decided=\\\"Target\\\", exit=\\\"Would not improve earlier offer\\\", obasis=\\\"Stated\\\",\\n  related=\\\"after R049\\\"),\\n\\nR(rowid=\\\"R055\\\", n=55, when=\\\"by 08/12/2016\\\", who=\\\"Party E\\\", what=\\\"Not selected at signing\\\", rnd=\\\"3\\\",\\n  type=\\\"Strategic\\\",\\n  terms=\\\"Inferred: silent — last reported act was confirming its original $21.26 proposal on 08/02/2016 (R047) after withdrawing its revised proposal; never mentioned again before signing. Stage left: Round 3.\\\",\\n  why=\\\"Inferred: “\\\" + Q[\\\"ewd\\\"] + \\\"” (p.30) is its last appearance; no notice of exclusion or withdrawal after it is reported. The row records only that Party E was out by signing, not how or why (Q4).\\\",\\n  source=[\\\"P-024\\\", \\\"P-033\\\"], review=\\\"Q4\\\", count=1,\\n  dto=\\\"2016-08-12\\\", wdate=\\\"2016-08-12\\\",\\n  dbasis=\\\"Relative only\\\", dmethod=\\\"Assigned: bound\\\", page=32,\\n  decided=\\\"Unknown\\\", exit=\\\"Not stated\\\", obasis=\\\"Inferred: silent\\\"),\\n\\nR(rowid=\\\"R056\\\", n=56, when=\\\"08/12/2016\\\", who=\\\"PWRR and G&W (with Merger Sub)\\\",\\n  what=\\\"Merger agreement signed\\\", rnd=\\\"3\\\",\\n  terms=\\\"Agreed consideration $25.00 per share in cash (preferred converts 100-for-1 plus accrued/unpaid dividends); Board approval (Director Smith recused) after BMO's oral fairness opinion of the same date; Eder Trusts (842,742 common; 500 preferred) executed a voting agreement with G&W and the Company; termination fee $3,785,000; no go-shop; outside date 12/31/2016 (02/28/2017 if only STB approval remains). Signing is not process termination and is not a new bid.\\\",\\n  why=\\\"Stated: “\\\" + Q[\\\"exec\\\"] + \\\"” (p.32), “\\\" + Q[\\\"opinion\\\"] + \\\"” (p.32), “\\\" + Q[\\\"superior\\\"] + \\\"” (p.32) and “\\\" + Q[\\\"fee3785\\\"] + \\\"” (p.34); G&W draft terms favored the winner: “\\\" + Q[\\\"gwx\\\"] + \\\"” (p.32). Routine approval/opinion details incorporated here. No go-shop or post-signing competing proposal is reported in the supplied filing.\\\",\\n  source=[\\\"P-032\\\", \\\"P-033\\\", \\\"X-014\\\", \\\"X-016\\\", \\\"X-026\\\"], count=None,\\n  dfrom=\\\"2016-08-12\\\", dto=\\\"2016-08-12\\\", wdate=\\\"2016-08-12\\\",\\n  dbasis=\\\"Reported day\\\", dmethod=\\\"Reported\\\", page=32,\\n  related=\\\"R053 (accepted); R054; R049; voting agreement noted\\\"),\\n\\nR(rowid=\\\"R057\\\", n=57, when=\\\"08/15/2016\\\", who=\\\"PWRR\\\", what=\\\"Merger announced\\\", rnd=\\\"3\\\",\\n  terms=\\\"Press release publicly announced the transaction on Monday 08/15/2016 before the opening of trading of the common stock on NASDAQ. Separate from signing (08/12/2016).\\\",\\n  why=\\\"Stated: “\\\" + Q[\\\"ann\\\"] + \\\"” (p.32). Publicity occurred after signing; no earlier sale-process announcement is reported.\\\",\\n  source=[\\\"P-033\\\"], count=None,\\n  dfrom=\\\"2016-08-15\\\", dto=\\\"2016-08-15\\\", wdate=\\\"2016-08-15\\\",\\n  dbasis=\\\"Reported day\\\", dmethod=\\\"Reported\\\", page=32),\\n]\\n\", \"path\": \"/home/uctpiaj/work/rows_ledger.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824925488,"end":1789824990795}}}}
