{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789825086188,"sessionID":"ses_f462b5375ffe0Xe1Ogn1j4dMvc","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9e3722e001VCuWjh16ZOTSAw","sessionID":"ses_f462b5375ffe0Xe1Ogn1j4dMvc","messageID":"msg_0b9e36766001Q3eKYw7YvAige0","type":"tool","id":"call_00_M7hs9iUJ9zxkiFIFcCkn6403","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /home/uctpiaj/work && grep -n '\"nost\\|\"nda\"' rows_ledger.py | head"},"output":"18:\"nda\": \"Each of the potential strategic buyers and 14 potential financial buyers subsequently executed confidentiality agreements.\",\n19:\"nostand\": \"The confidentiality agreements did not contain any “standstill” or similar provision that would prohibit a potential buyer from submitting a proposal or making an offer to acquire the Company.\",\n187:  why=\"Stated: “\" + Q[\"nda\"] + \"” (p.28) and “\" + Q[\"nost\"] + \"” (p.28). Inferred: agreements executed after the contact wave and exist by 04/22/2016, when the memorandum went to buyers that had executed them (R014). Working date = window midpoint (Q7).\",\n195:  why=\"Stated: “\" + Q[\"nda\"] + \"” (p.28). Inferred: same window as R012. Cohort split by type as supplied (Q3).\",\n245:  why=\"Inferred: arithmetic base — “\" + Q[\"nda\"] + \"” (p.28) and “\" + Q[\"iois\"] + \"” (p.29); the Reasons section states “\" + Q[\"25\"] + \"” (p.33). Eligibility: all potential buyers were advised to submit IOIs (R015). Closing inference at the first identified transition (Q4).\",\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"18:\"nda\": \"Each of the potential strategic buyers and 14 potential financial buyers subsequently executed confidentiality agreements.\",\n19:\"nostand\": \"The confidentiality agreements did not contain any “standstill” or similar provision that would prohibit a potential buyer from submitting a proposal or making an offer to acquire the Company.\",\n187:  why=\"Stated: “\" + Q[\"nda\"]